<title>UK: Rabobank sets 150 million stg three-year bond.</title>
<headline>Rabobank sets 150 million stg three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by joint lead managers Credit Suisse First Boston and HSBC</p>
<p>Markets.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RABOBANK NEDERLANDS</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN STG   COUPON     6.75	MATURITY    18.FEB.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.9875  PAY DATE    18.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.80     SPREAD	+13 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/NL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.1875    SELL CONC  1.1875</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.0 pct AUG 1999 GILT</p>
<p> NOTES	SENIOR, UNSECURED AND UNSUBORDINATED.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
